      default: prn\n\n     - :caught, function of one argument, a throwable, called when\n       read, eval, or print throws an exception or error\n       default: repl-caught" _kc$26301 435 _kc$26302 1 _kc$26303 "clojure/main.clj")))) _kc$26304))))
